## SumUp Deep-Hunt Analysis — 2026-09-07 (bigpickle)

### STEP 1 — DELTA
- NEW `help.sumup.com`: Vercel Next.js i18n help center (44 locales), live article/section/search/pos/AI-assistant routes. `support.sumup.com` 308-alias to it. First real characterization of the "support" asset.
- NEW `sse.sumup.com`: search service (SSE) discovered via help client JS (`NEXT_PUBLIC_SEARCH_SERVICE_ENDPOINT=https://sse.sumup.com/sse/scss`, `SSE_SERVICE`). Root /sse/scss all GET → 404; behind the same `apigateway2-headless` Envoy gateway as api.sumup.com.
- CHANGED `dashboard.sumup.com`: 308 → `me.sumup.com` (pure alias to already-characterized Vercel OAuth asset); closes the seed-era "unprobed dashboard" gap — no distinct surface.
- CHANGED `help.sumup.com/api/search/*`: `/api/search/articles` and `/api/search/query` → deterministic 500 unauthenticated (while every other API route returns 404/307) — a live serverless route failing server-side, pointing at the sse backend.

