- [NEW] Full parse of sumup/sumup-openapi `openapi.yaml`: `apiKey` = opaque static Bearer (no aud/exp; created at me.sumup.com/settings/api-keys); oauth2 `authorizationCode` at legacy pair `api.sumup.com/authorize`+`/token`; `clientCredentials` declared at `api.sumup.com/token` with EXACT 16-scope catalog (payments, checkouts.read/write, transactions.history/read, refunds.write, receipts.read, user.profile_readonly/profile/app-settings, payment_instruments, customers.read/write, user.payout-settings, payouts.read, user.subaccounts) — refines prior "13 REST scopes".
- [NEW] `servers: [https://api.sumup.com]` only in spec; empty-scope ops (`/v0.1/merchants/{merchant_code}/payment-methods`, `PUT /v0.2/checkouts/{checkout_id}/apple-pay-session`) declare `apiKey:[] + oauth2:[]` — no per-op scope requirement, any valid Bearer qualifies.
- NO_DELTA on live probe surface elsewhere; `reports/contentful-preview-token-leak.md` still absent (verified via `ls`), valid-bugs.md running count 0.

