## STEP 1 — DELTA
- **[NEW]** `gateway.sumup.com` = **SumUp production Online-Payments Hosted Fields card-entry component** (`<title>hostedfields</title>`, `HostedForm.init(window, window.parent)`, 26KB `hosted.js`, references `api.sumup.com` + `checkout.sumup.com`, 16 APM methods incl. Bancontact/BLIK/Sofort/PIX). Vercel-served, CNAME → shared apex `cname.vercel-dns.com` (66.33.60.129 / 76.76.21.22). **Never probed in 28 cycles** — the most PCI-relevant host in the estate was absent from inventory because scope was driven by the 9-host seed list.
- **[NEW]** `pos.sumup.com` = **"SumUp Back-Office"** (AngularJS SPA, `icash` i18n) on third-party CNAME `sumup.gastrofix.com` (Gastrofix = third-party POS vendor). `/client/` 200 (2395B nginx). Bundle exposes `/login/impersonate`, `/api_connection`, `apiToken`. **Never probed in 28 cycles.**
- **[NEW]** `soap.sumup.com` CNAME → `internal-sumup-live-soap-int-alb-1380371279.eu-west-1.elb.amazonaws.com` — a **publicly DNS-published ELB whose name declares itself internal** (SOAP/XML stack, classic WSDL+XXE class). Does **not** answer externally (egress proven live via `api.sumup.com` 200 + `example.com` 200 controls).
- **[NEW]** CT ground truth: **226 unique `*.sumup.com` names; 191 first-label names never probed.** Prior "exhaustive" enumerations were exhaustive only over callback *hosts*, never over the host *inventory*.
- **[CHANGED]** `gateway.sumup.com` message handling characterised: inbound handler destructures only `{data, source}` and gates on `MessageEvent.source === expectedWindow` — **`event.origin` is never read**; outbound is `postMessage(...,"*")` (hardcoded wildcard, plus `n||"*"`). Page sets `ACAO: *` with **no `X-Frame-Options` and no CSP `frame-ancestors`** (framable by any origin).
- **[CHANGED]** `pos.sumup.com` backend is **absent**: `/client/login`, `/client/login/impersonate`, `/client/api/api_connection` → nginx 404; `/api/*` → **503 "No server is available"**. Dormant static deployment, no anonymous data surface.
- **[NEW]** `fiori.sumup.com` → bare IP 95.158.146.79 (no CDN, SAP Fiori stack) — **does not respond**. `yapily.sumup.com` → CF 403 `error code: 1002` (firewall). `pepadmin`/`testhelp`/`kds`/`settlements-sandbox`/`apicore-uk` → NXDOMAIN. `testhelp` NXDOMAIN kills the "test env re-leaks Contentful preview token" lead.

