## STEP 4 — SELF-CRITIQUE
- **[PARKED]** `gateway.sumup.com` hosted-fields message handling: dropped to 35 and parked — no `event.origin` validation and framable-by-any-origin are real, but the component sets **no cookie** and takes `checkoutId`/`sessionId` from the parent that is *trusted by design*, so no privilege boundary is crossed. This is hardening; it is also the "clickjacking/headers without demonstrated exploit" rejection class. I will not file it, and I will not inflate it.
- **[PARKED]** `pos.sumup.com` back-office: 15, refuted — backend absent (503), all routes 404. No anonymous surface.
- **[FINAL]** 1) `auth.sam-app.ro/oauth2/register` (85, PASSIVE, evidence complete — blocked only on HUMAN submission, 14th cycle); 2) `api.sumup.com/v0.2/checkouts/{id}/apple-pay-session` SSRF (60, AUTH_HELPED, Critical if true); 3) `api.sumup.com` aud/iss binding (65, AUTH_HELPED). This cycle: no new bounty claim, one material inventory correction, two refuted classes.

