## STEP 4 — SELF-CRITIQUE

[PARKED] Prod `kid`-optional try-all deviation on mcp.sumup.com/mcp: real and reproducible (`multiple matching keys found in the JSON Web Key Set`), RFC 8725 §3.11 non-compliance, but the verifier is otherwise sound — alg allowlist {RS256, EdDSA}, `none`/HS256 refused, trust store exactly the 8 published kids. Widening 1-of-1 to 1-of-7 has no exploit path while every private key is held, so it is hardening plus trust-store-membership disclosure, not a bypass. Kept as supporting evidence inside H1, not as a standalone claim.
[PARKED] `api.sam-app.ro` gateway bearer validation: no discriminator reproducible on 7 paths; cannot distinguish "validates silently" from "does not validate" passively, and the KB's prior "structured vs plain 404" control does not reproduce. Archived as a KB correction.
