# Missing `event.origin` validation in the SumUp hosted-fields card-entry frame

**Asset:** `https://gateway.sumup.com/` (`/` shell, `/hosted.js`)
**Downstream call:** `PUT https://api.sumup.com/v0.2/checkouts/{checkoutId}`
**Class:** MISCONFIG (missing origin validation on a cross-origin message API)
--- tail ---
   DENY` to `/` and `/hosted.js`.
4. Do not trust `product_origin` from the message body; derive it server-side.
5. Ship (1) and (2) together — see §5.
