- Q3 provable non-invasively? **YES** — 4 `curl` greps over the served bundle; no card data, no
  merchant account, no mutation against live customer data.
- Q4 novel? **YES** — 31 cycles of inventory never mapped `gateway.sumup.com`; a prior cycle recorded
  it as a "non-Next 404" from a single path.
