[NEW] **`js.sumup.com/api/checkouts/{id}` is LIVE, application-routed and unauthenticated** — RFC 9457 body `"Checkout <id> does not exist."`, 404/181 B `application/json`, no `Authorization`, no cookie, no `X-SumUp-Widget-Session-Id`. Three distinct application response classes confirmed.
