[NEW] **Corrects a three-cycle-old claim.** The `checkoutId` gate was recorded as a runtime `new RegExp(a.pattern)` that was "unrecoverable from served bytes". In `sdk.js` it is a **static literal**, recovered verbatim above. More useful than the pattern: the gate is **client-side only**.
