1302f1d6a8fa330a71e50647be0281e4b977a198cbf27e0fd59cbecc9f220873  -
$ curl -sS https://gateway.sumup.com/hosted.js | grep -c 'event\.origin'
0
$ curl -sSI https://gateway.sumup.com/ | grep -icE '^(x-frame-options|content-security-policy)'
0
```

Anatomy/hygiene, not client data. No account, no card, no customer record was used.
