404 84 text/plain; charset=utf-8
$ curl -sS https://js.sumup.com/api/checkouts/AAAA-not-a-uuid
... "detail":"Checkout AAAA-not-a-uuid does not exist." ...
```

No authentication, no customer data, no card data, no live checkout was read or modified.
