2. Throwaway-checkout test to prove the PUT is accepted server-side. This is the single leg separating Medium from High, and I can't cross it passively or without a merchant test account.
3. DCR scope escalation (`scp=[]` → any non-empty grant) requires an authorized `POST /oauth2/register`, which is a mutation.

I did not touch items 2 or 3 — both are outside passive GET/HEAD/OPTIONS probing. If you want me to proceed on either, I need explicit authorization and (for #2) a merchant test account or your own throwaway checkout.
