- Staging exposure is often dismissed as low severity; the prod-diff plus a real MCP consumer is
  the argument that makes it worth triaging, and it must be presented as staging-scoped.
- Scope on `auth.sam-app.ro` must stay read-only plus one client registration — no attempts to
  enumerate or touch real merchant accounts behind staging.
