  - | Why reachable | `form--submit` is registered via `onAny`, whose dispatch sits OUTSIDE the only source check (`t && i !== t || ...`). Widget root returns `200`/546 B with no `X-Frame-Options`, no CSP `frame-ancestors`, no `Referrer-Policy`. |
