  - | Q2 Provable non-invasively? | **YES** — static analysis of served bytes plus a passive `GET /` header check. No mutation performed. |
  - | Q3 Real impact? | **PARTIAL** — client-side, the frame issues `PUT https://api.sumup.com/v0.2/checkouts/{id}` with attacker-supplied `sessionId`/`payment`/`product.origin`. **Server-side acceptance NOT yet proven**, so severity capped at Medium. No read path claimed. |
