## Important Details
- Scope: SumUp-owned infrastructure and applications only; disclosure channel is `bugs.olivermaicher.eu` per `scope.yml:4`.
- Live testing must remain passive-first, `<=1 rps`, and limited to `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`; no mutating requests, auth bypass, or customer-data testing.
- Output constraints: top three assets, at most one hypothesis each; drop confidence `<40`, rejected classes, or hypotheses without exact verification; emit exactly one `[NEXT]` action.
- Workspace is repeatedly re-materialized between cycles. Start with `ls`; never trust a prior file-existence claim without checking.
