## Important Details
- Scope: SumUp-owned infrastructure and applications only; disclosure channel is `bugs.olivermaicher.eu` per `scope.yml:4`.
- Live testing must remain passive-first, `<=1 rps`, and limited to `GET`/`HEAD`/`OPTIONS`; no mutating requests, auth bypass, or customer-data testing.
- Output constraints: top three assets, at most one hypothesis each; drop confidence `<40`, rejected classes, or hypotheses without exact verification; emit exactly one `[NEXT]` action.
- Workspace is repeatedly re-materialized between cycles. Start with `ls`; never trust a prior file-existence claim without checking.
- Any new report must be written and read back with `ls`/`wc`/`sha256sum` in the same command before referencing it.
- No repository submission mechanism exists. `scripts/sync-issues.py` and `.github/workflows/sync-issues.yml` mirror leads only.
- Gateway report currently recorded as `reports/gateway-hostedfields-cross-origin-messenger.md`: 234 lines, 9,967 B, sha256 `36c78b62bb0a8715ac86be9e2fc64a97ae11caff2965d2fa59a486ca5b2af06d`.
- Current gateway confidence is 88, `HUMAN_ONLY`, Medium cap; the earlier 90/PASSIVE score is stale because API acceptance and business impact still require sandbox validation.
