impact: Hardening deviation only — kid-optional try-all widens verification surface but no key confusion or alg confusion bypass exists (HS256/none rejected, cross-env keys isolated). Severity: Low (informational).
testability: PASSIVE (kid/alg matrix proven); HUMAN_ONLY for exploit development (none exists).
