- 2 lead(s) marked VALID at 2026-10-04 00:50:00 UTC
  - **Verdict: VALID** — gateway messenger inbound handler never validates `event.origin`; `form--submit` is registered via `onAny` (`ignoreVariant: true`), so any origin supplying `type:"SumUpCard"` reaches `processCheckout` and emits `PUT https://api.sumup.com/v0.2/checkouts/{id}`. UUID gate is a static public regex (byte 17859), not a secret. Widget shell (546 B) has no XFO/CSP frame-ancestors/Referrer-Policy. Bounded: response never returned (blind), and downstream acceptance unconfirmed because `product_origin`/`session_id` drop when attacker does not control widget URL params. Same defect in `gateway.sumup.com/sdk.js`. Evidence: `reports/gateway-hostedfields-cross-origin-messenger.md`. hosted.js 26,839 B sha256 `1302f1d6a8fa330a71e50647be0281e4b977a198cbf27e0fd59cbecc9f220873`.
  - **Verdict: VALID (staging only)** — unauthenticated RFC 7591 dynamic client registration at `auth.sam-app.ro/oauth2/register` returns `201` with attacker-supplied client + issued `client_id`/`client_secret`; registered clients mint signed JWTs via `client_credentials`. Mitigations: empty forced scope, PKCE required, no client-management endpoints, staging not federated with production, zero JWKS key overlap with prod. Bounded: no production route for DCR and no demonstrated staging-to-production relay. Evidence: `reports/auth-sam-app-ro-dynamic-registration.md`. Discovery re-confirmed 2026-10-04 (`registration_endpoint` advertised); state-changing requests deliberately not replayed.
EOF
