## Important Details
- **Submission channel**: bugs.olivermaicher.eu (private program). No automated issue creation mechanism present; `scripts/sync-issues.py` + `.github/workflows/sync-issues.yml` only mirror leads. 
- **Workspace persistence**: Workspace re-materializes between cycles (uniform mtimes, `reports/` only contains `logs/`, `hypotheses/`, `valid-bugs.md` at baseline 79 lines/7,384 B/`282390f8` on open). Any artifact written in cycle N does not persist to N+1 — `ls` + `wc` + `sha256sum` must be performed in the same act as writing before referencing a `[NEW]` file claim.
- **Top active findings**: 
  - `gateway.sumup.com/hosted.js` — cross-origin postMessage checkout-write (no `event.origin` validation; inbound handler never reads `event.origin`; `origin` only used outbound `t.postMessage(e, n||"*")` with `n=document.referrer`). `hosted.js` sha256 `1302f1d6a8fa330a71e50647be0281e4b977a198cbf27e0fd59cbecc9f220873` (26,839 B). Report: `reports/gateway-hostedfields-cross-origin-messenger.md` (234 L / 9,967 B / `36c78b62bb0a8715ac86be9e2fc64a97ae11caff2965d2fa59a486ca5b2af06d`).
  - `auth.sam-app.ro/oauth2/register` — unauthenticated RFC 7591 DCR LIVE (POST → 201 `client_id`+`client_secret`+redirect_uris). Mints JWTs with empty `scp`, attacker-controlled `aud`; dynamic clients require PKCE, per-client redirect allowlist, no RFC7592, not synced to `api.sam-app.ro/authorize` (invalid_client). Cross-env JWKS isolation: prod 8 keys, staging 9 unique keys, **ZERO** kid overlap (staging includes `loadtesting` kid). Report: `reports/auth-sam-app-ro-dynamic-registration.md` (132 L / 7,172 B / `ffffbc027e7fb852507054340a246e4e968bf17868dd2175fe976c4ff5b6fdb1`).
- **Retired/closed leads**: `api.sumup.com/v0.2/checkouts/{id}/payment-methods` IDOR (92% confidence) retired after credential matrix (7 shapes × 5 IDs) returned byte-identical 404/58 B `{"error_code":"NOT_FOUND","message":"checkout not found"}` (application-routed but param-invariant and credential-invariant). `js.sumup.com/api/checkouts/{id}` BFF oracle refuted (4/4 credential differentials failed → 68 B Vercel platform 404). `pos-payment.sumup.com` route-enum refuted by negative control.
- **Methodological learnings**: sweep only exhaustive over values actually sent (e.g. legacy-callback sweep used wrong path `/callback` instead of registered `/api/sso/callback`); a single negative sample does not characterize a host (must use negative controls); parameter presence ≠ enforcement; header-based attribution (`x-envoy-decorator-operation`, `problem+json`) identifies the responder, not universal gating; when a failure repeats across cycles, test the component in isolation before re-running the failing path.
- **Constraint**: read-only probes only (GET/HEAD/OPTIONS), <= 1 rps. No auth-bypass or mutating tests against live customer data. Treat measurements of volatile store as valid only while store survives.

