[LEARN] ACCEPTED OTHER @ workspace: 43 re-materializations, and the carry-forward this cycle asserted two verified report files that were simply gone. The only reliable primitive is `open with ls`, and any inherited artifact hash must be treated as a claim about a file that may not exist until hashed in the current cycle.
[LEARN] REJECTED OATH @ js.sumup.com/api/checkouts/{id}: conflicting lead states remain unresolved across cycles (181 B application reflector vs 68 B Vercel platform 404). Not carried forward as a finding. An id echoed into a 404 detail field is a reflector, not a disclosure;4/4 credential differentials failed.
