# SumUp — unauthenticated RFC 7591 dynamic client registration on auth.sam-app.ro

- **Status:** ready to file
- **Report channel:** bugs.olivermaicher.eu (`scope.yml:4`)
- **Class:** AUTH / OAuth configuration
- **Severity:** Low–Medium (staging-only, blast radius bounded — see Impact)
- **Evidence basis:** discovery re-derived passively (GET) on 2026-10-06 UTC;
  registration behaviour verified live (POST) in the 2026-09-06 cycle

## Target

`https://auth.sam-app.ro` — SumUp's publicly reachable staging authorization
server (staging stack: `mcp`, `mcp-theta`, `api`, `api-theta`, `auth`,
`auth-theta`).

## The bug

RFC 7591 Dynamic Client Registration is enabled and reachable without
authentication, and it is advertised in the OIDC discovery document.
