## Objective
- Act as a senior bug-bounty analyst for the SumUp program (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu), running the 7-step deep-hunt loop each cycle: delta, prioritize, hypotheses, self-critique, next action, learning, risk.
- Deliver two fileable findings (gateway cross-origin postMessage; auth.sam-app.ro DCR) as report artifacts and drive HUMAN submission.

## Important Details
- Passive-first rule: live probes limited to GET/HEAD/OPTIONS at ≤1 rps; no mutating tests against live customer data; DCR re-verification requires POST and is deliberately skipped (would create live OAuth clients).
- Report channel per `scope.yml:4` = bugs.olivermaicher.eu (private program); `scripts/sync-issues.py` + `.github/workflows/sync-issues.yml` mirror leads only — no submission mechanism in repo.
- Workspace re-materializes between cycles (43 confirmed occurrences): artifacts written in cycle N do not persist to N+1. `reports/valid-bugs.md` reverts to exact baseline 79 L / 7,384 B / sha `282390f83b221317…`. Always open with `ls` before trusting any `[NEW]` file claim; write + `sha256sum` in the same command.
- Key evidence constants: `hosted.js` 26,839 B, sha256 `1302f1d6a8fa330a71e50647be0281e4b977a198cbf27e0fd59cbecc9f220873`; `sdk.js` 291,877 B, sha256 `0fae546ae34ee5e97cf0c3107d87adaa79129983d423bce6cf9a0fc19916c7bd`; `grep -c 'event\.'` → 0; PoC envelope `TYPE:"SumUpCard"`, `ACTION_MESSAGE:"message"`, `variant:"hostedfield"`; checkoutId gate is a STATIC literal `ue=/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[089ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i` (NOT `new RegExp(a.pattern)` — recurring error).
- Scope rejections that shape framing: clickjacking-without-exploit rejected (report must demonstrate the state-changing PUT); wildcard-CORS+credentials class rejected program-wide (no capability differential).
- Closed/retired leads (do not re-open): api.sumup.com payment-methods IDOR (credential matrix 7×5 all byte-identical 404/58B); js.sumup.com/api/checkouts/{id} (68B Vercel platform 404, 4/4 credential differentials failed); pos-payment path enum (negative control identical 403); crt.sh diff (self-defeating, 0 unmapped); Contentful preview token (rotated 401, report file never existed); auth.sam-app.ro "attacker-controlled aud → prod relay" leg (unfalsifiable).
- Corrections to carry: staging JWKS 11 entries = 9 unique keys (two `public:*` duplicated); prod JWKS 8 keys, zero kid overlap; staging discovery advertises 20 scopes_supported; DCR prod client-provenance-sync path = UNTESTED, not safe.

