- gateway finding fully verified from served bytes this cycle: no `event.origin` validation, no X-Frame-Options/frame-ancestors, `payment_type !== "card"` skips frame-access gate, `origin` param used only outbound (`t.postMessage(e, n||"*")`), `X-SumUp-Widget-Session-Id` injected unconditionally (string `"undefined"` when absent), PoC proven live (netlog PUT `/v0.2/checkouts/{uuid}`).
- DCR finding verified: POST `/oauth2/register` → 201 unauthenticated, JWTs minted with empty `scp` + attacker-set `aud`, bounded by empty scope + zero JWKS kid overlap + prod `/register` → 404.
