## Objective
- Act as senior bug bounty analyst for SumUp program (report channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu), running an 8-step hypothesis cycle (DELTA → PRIORITIZE → HYPOTHESES → SELF-CRITIQUE → NEXT → LEARNING → RISK) on passive-only recon against in-scope SumUp assets.
