## Important Details
- **Scope & rules:** Only company-owned infrastructure, payment platforms, merchant portals, APIs, mobile/web, POS, cloud services, websites/domains operated by SumUp Group/subsidiaries. Passive-first (≤1 rps), GET/HEAD/OPTIONS only for live probes, no mutating tests against live customer data, no endpoint-map-only claims, facts vs hypotheses strictly separated. Submission channel: bugs.olivermaicher.eu per `scope.yml:4`.
- **Submission mechanism:** Repo has no automated submission to bugs.olivermaicher.eu; `scripts/sync-issues.py` and `.github/workflows/sync-issues.yml` mirror leads only. Human submission required.
- **Workspace persistence:** Workspace re-materializes between cycles (45+ cycles observed). Untracked `reports/*.md` do **not** persist to next cycle; tracked `reports/analyst-*.log` and `knowledge/index.md` are git-persisted and used to restore lost report bytes when needed. Any `[NEW]` file claim must be written and verified with `ls`, `wc -l`, `sha256sum`, `head`, `tail` in the **same command** before referencing (write+hash = same act). Treat file claims without in-context hash as unproven.
- **Evidence discipline:** Gateway code citations re-read from served bytes (minified) before writing reports. Negative controls and credential/param-invariance matrices required to avoid transient outliers. Exhaustive sweeps only exhaustive over values actually sent (path-shape guesses insufficient).
- **Key verified facts:** `gateway.sumup.com/hosted.js` is byte-identical 26,839 B, sha256 `1302f1d6a8fa330a71e50647be0281e4b977a198cbf27e0fd59cbecc9f220873`. No `event.origin` validation present; inbound postMessage handler never reads `event.origin` (guard exists but applied backwards). Three messenger sites with two branches using literal `"*"` outbound (wildcard outbound is live in parts), not uniformly blocked. UUID/shape gate is a static literal in served bundle. Cross-origin PoC envelope constants: `TYPE:"SumUpCard"`, `ACTION_MESSAGE:"message"`, `variant:"hostedfield"`, `form--submit` = `$`.
- **Staging DCR:** `auth.sam-app.ro/oauth2/register` is RFC 7591 unauthenticated dynamic client registration (POST → 201) declared in discovery; mints JWTs with empty `scp:[]` and attacker-controlled `aud`. Staging JWKS has 11 entries but **9 unique keys** (two `public:*` duplicated) vs prod 8; **zero kid overlap** across envs. Prod `/register` absent (404). Prod client-provenance-sync path is **UNTESTED** (passive-only).
- **Passive surface:** Core API/auth surfaces byte-stable across many cycles; only live bearer discriminates aud/iss binding on many endpoints. Money/auth recon largely exhausted passively.

