| Prod relay via client sync | ❌ **Untested** — no evidence of client provenance sync to prod; three framings in log: "client-level sync to prod provenance DB untested", "not synced to prod api", "prod JWKS rejects staging tokens" |

**Fileable as:** Staging posture finding (misconfiguration: unauthenticated DCR + mintable tokens with empty scope). **No prod impact demonstrated.**

